From: folia-linear-build <folia-linear-build@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Linear region config

Paper-side Linear region configuration: global flush keys plus a
per-world format selector; reads probe both extensions so flipping the
format never hides existing data. Global flush keys are inert and
threadless in this release (no pool wiring yet).

